==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Surskit|130}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion; both cards have the Quick Attack attack.
*{{m|Quick Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Surskit}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

